{
  "module": "brain",
  "title": "大脑",
  "component": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "api",
        "name": "Brain 接口",
        "kind": "interface",
        "boundary": "provided",
        "source": "brain/README.md#brain-contracts",
        "methods": [
          "brain.decide",
          "brain.get",
          "brain.cancel"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "service",
        "name": "DecisionService",
        "kind": "component",
        "boundary": "internal",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#module-shape"
      },
      {
        "id": "reader",
        "name": "ContextReader",
        "kind": "component",
        "boundary": "internal",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#module-shape"
      },
      {
        "id": "rules",
        "name": "DecisionPolicy / ProposalValidator",
        "kind": "component",
        "boundary": "internal",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#module-shape"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "name": "RecoveryWorker",
        "kind": "component",
        "boundary": "internal",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#module-shape"
      },
      {
        "id": "store",
        "name": "DecisionStore",
        "kind": "component",
        "boundary": "internal",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#module-shape"
      },
      {
        "id": "adapter",
        "name": "ModelAdapter",
        "kind": "component",
        "boundary": "internal",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#module-shape"
      },
      {
        "id": "content",
        "name": "内容读取接口",
        "kind": "interface",
        "boundary": "required",
        "source": "memory/README.md",
        "methods": [
          "content.get"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "grant",
        "name": "使用依据接口",
        "kind": "interface",
        "boundary": "required",
        "source": "security/README.md",
        "methods": [
          "grant.use",
          "grant.use.get"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "service",
        "to": "api",
        "type": "realization",
        "label": "提供"
      },
      {
        "from": "service",
        "to": "reader",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "输入及来源检查"
      },
      {
        "from": "service",
        "to": "store",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "接纳／查询／取消"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "to": "reader",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "固定上下文"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "to": "rules",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "路径 / 校验"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "to": "store",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "阶段／调用事实"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "to": "adapter",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "生成／原调用核对"
      },
      {
        "from": "reader",
        "to": "content",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "准确字节 / 资格"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "to": "grant",
        "type": "dependency",
        "label": "原使用依据"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Home 组装上下文并独立准入；Brain 不拥有 Task 写权。",
      "DecisionStore 绑定宿主事务与 jobs；模型与内容调用在事务外。",
      "默认每轮零或一次物理生成；ModelAdapter 不执行模型返回的工具调用。"
    ]
  },
  "data": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "request",
        "name": "DecisionRequest",
        "owner": "Home 固定；Brain 绑定",
        "schema": "DecisionRequest",
        "attributes": [
          {
            "name": "decision_id",
            "type": "ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "task_id",
            "type": "ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "snapshot_revision",
            "type": "Revision"
          },
          {
            "name": "context_ref",
            "type": "ContentRef"
          },
          {
            "name": "model_profile_ref",
            "type": "ComponentRef"
          }
        ],
        "source": "contracts/schemas/protocol.schema.json#/$defs/DecisionRequest"
      },
      {
        "id": "context",
        "name": "BrainContext",
        "owner": "Home（正文由内容 owner 保存）",
        "schema": "BrainContext",
        "attributes": [
          {
            "name": "task_ref",
            "type": "TaskRef"
          },
          {
            "name": "snapshot_revision",
            "type": "Revision"
          },
          {
            "name": "goal_revision",
            "type": "Revision"
          },
          {
            "name": "control_revision",
            "type": "Revision"
          },
          {
            "name": "input_manifest",
            "type": "ContentRef[0..100]"
          }
        ],
        "source": "contracts/schemas/protocol.schema.json#/$defs/BrainContext"
      },
      {
        "id": "decision",
        "name": "DecisionRecord",
        "owner": "Brain",
        "schema": "DecisionRecord",
        "attributes": [
          {
            "name": "decision_id",
            "type": "ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "revision",
            "type": "Revision"
          },
          {
            "name": "snapshot_revision",
            "type": "Revision"
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "type": "DecisionStatus"
          }
        ],
        "source": "contracts/schemas/protocol.schema.json#/$defs/DecisionRecord"
      },
      {
        "id": "call",
        "name": "ModelCall",
        "owner": "Brain",
        "schema": "ModelCall",
        "attributes": [
          {
            "name": "model_call_id",
            "type": "ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "provider_request_id",
            "type": "String?"
          },
          {
            "name": "state",
            "type": "ModelCallState"
          },
          {
            "name": "usage",
            "type": "Amount[0..100]"
          },
          {
            "name": "usage_final",
            "type": "Boolean"
          }
        ],
        "source": "contracts/schemas/protocol.schema.json#/$defs/ModelCall"
      },
      {
        "id": "proposal",
        "name": "Proposal",
        "owner": "Brain（本轮结果值）",
        "schema": "Proposal",
        "attributes": [
          {
            "name": "kind",
            "type": "ProposalKind"
          },
          {
            "name": "rationale",
            "type": "String"
          },
          {
            "name": "evidence_refs",
            "type": "ContentRef[0..100]"
          },
          {
            "name": "assumptions",
            "type": "String[0..100]"
          }
        ],
        "source": "contracts/schemas/protocol.schema.json#/$defs/Proposal"
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "request",
        "to": "context",
        "type": "association",
        "fromMultiplicity": "0..*",
        "toMultiplicity": "1",
        "label": "绑定固定正文",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md",
        "constraint": "context_ref 固定一个 BrainContext；不声明该内容只能被一个决策引用。"
      },
      {
        "from": "request",
        "to": "decision",
        "type": "association",
        "fromMultiplicity": "1",
        "toMultiplicity": "0..1",
        "label": "按原身份接纳",
        "source": "brain/implementation.md#data-flow",
        "constraint": "成功接纳后恰好一份原决策；被拒请求可无记录。"
      },
      {
        "from": "decision",
        "to": "call",
        "type": "association",
        "fromMultiplicity": "1",
        "toMultiplicity": "0..1",
        "label": "可选模型调用",
        "source": "brain/README.md#brain-contracts",
        "constraint": "确定性路径不创建 ModelCall；换 worker 不创建第二次物理调用。"
      },
      {
        "from": "decision",
        "to": "proposal",
        "type": "association",
        "fromMultiplicity": "0..*",
        "toMultiplicity": "0..1",
        "label": "完成时返回",
        "source": "brain/README.md#brain-contracts",
        "constraint": "仅 completed 有 proposal；不推导 Proposal 内容在不同决策间全局独占。"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "DecisionRecord→ModelCall 为 0..1；Proposal 只在 completed 有效。",
      "跨 owner：BrainContext 由 Home 固定；提案仍须 Home 当前准入。",
      "cancelled 与模型停止、usage_final 独立；迟到账单只更新原调用事实。"
    ]
  },
  "reading_notes": [
    "DecisionRecord 是线投影，DecisionStore 中的 brain_decision、decision_input、decision_output 与 jobs 保留接纳、输出和恢复责任。领域图不将这些存储表臆造为运行类继承体系。",
    "DecisionRequest.context_ref 绑定一个固定 BrainContext，输入正文及来源清单由 Home 组装。图中反向 0..* 不限制同一准确上下文版本被引用的次数；每次实际来源处理仍分别记事实。",
    "本轮可能直接给出确定性提案，因此 DecisionRecord→ModelCall 为 0..1。需要模型时同 decision_id 的 model_call 唯一；原决策查询及工作者更换不得再发送一次。",
    "Proposal 是结果值，图只列共同字段；act、need_context、request_input、complete、fail 是 kind 分支，不表示代码继承。提案没有全局唯一身份，反向关联不声明内容全局独占。",
    "供应商可能已处理而答复丢失时，Brain 查原调用；不支持查询则保留 provider_result_unknown 及费用责任。取消只关闭决策推进，ModelCall.stopped 需要停止证据；迟到输出不能改成新一轮提案。"
  ],
  "sources": [
    "brain/README.md",
    "brain/implementation.md",
    "task-runtime/implementation.md",
    "memory/README.md",
    "security/README.md",
    "contracts/schemas/protocol.schema.json",
    "contracts/schemas/methods.json"
  ]
}
